{"text":"<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3fsWjr7hZzA</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</span> ### 4. Dhātuyamakaṃ ^6-4-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Paṇṇattivāro ^6-4a-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"47.042313\">00:47</span> ##### (Ka) uddeso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11.799393\">00:11</span> 1. Aṭṭhārasa dhātuyo – cakkhudhātu, sotadhātu, ghānadhātu, jivhādhātu, kāyadhātu, rūpadhātu, saddadhātu, gandhadhātu, rasadhātu, phoṭṭhabbadhātu, cakkhuviññāṇadhātu, sotaviññāṇadhātu, ghānaviññāṇadhātu, jivhāviññāṇadhātu, kāyaviññāṇadhātu, manodhātu, manoviññāṇadhātu, dhammadhātu. ^6-4a-1</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Padasodhanavāro ^6-4b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"51.759529\">00:51</span> 2. (Ka) cakkhu cakkhudhātu? ^6-4b-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"57.417021\">00:57</span> (Kha) cakkhudhātu cakkhu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"59.763089\">00:59</span> (Ka) sotaṃ sotadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"62.556792\">01:02</span> (Kha) sotadhātu sotaṃ?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"65.454921\">01:05</span> (Ka) cakkhuviññāṇaṃ cakkhuviññāṇadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"69.494233\">01:09</span> (Kha) cakkhuviññāṇadhātu cakkhuviññāṇaṃ?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"73.904824\">01:13</span> (Ka) mano manodhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"76.351486\">01:16</span> (Kha) manodhātu mano?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"79.103024\">01:19</span> (Ka) manoviññāṇaṃ manoviññāṇadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"83.502703\">01:23</span> (Kha) manoviññāṇadhātu manoviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"87.212106\">01:27</span> (Ka) dhammo dhammadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"89.898546\">01:29</span> (Kha) dhammadhātu dhammo?</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"98.240334\">01:38</span> 3. (Ka) na cakkhu na cakkhudhātu? ^6-4b-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"101.64582\">01:41</span> (Kha) na cakkhudhātu na cakkhu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"104.847138\">01:44</span> (Ka) na sotaṃ na sotadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"107.48546\">01:47</span> (Kha) na sotadhātu na sotaṃ?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"111.353603\">01:51</span> (Ka) na cakkhuviññāṇaṃ na cakkhuviññāṇadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"116.105593\">01:56</span> (Kha) na cakkhuviññāṇadhātu na cakkhuviññāṇaṃ?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"120.446452\">02:00</span> (Ka) na mano na manodhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"123.768993\">02:03</span> (Kha) na manodhātu na mano?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"126.445527\">02:06</span> (Ka) na manoviññāṇaṃ na manoviññāṇadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"131.29143\">02:11</span> (Kha) na manoviññāṇadhātu na manoviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"135.80972\">02:15</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhammadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"139.749571\">02:19</span> (Kha) na dhammadhātu na dhammo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"147.581401\">02:27</span> #### 2. Padasodhanamūlacakkavāro ^6-4c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"150.71985\">02:30</span> 4. (Ka) cakkhu cakkhudhātu? ^6-4c-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"157.655383\">02:37</span> (Kha) dhātū [dhātu (sī. ka.) aññehi yamakehi saṃsanditabbaṃ] sotadhātu?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"160.170576\">02:40</span> (Ka) cakkhu cakkhudhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"162.326825\">02:42</span> (Kha) dhātū dhammadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"170.416846\">02:50</span> (Yathā āyatanayamake cakkaṃ bandhitaṃ evamidha cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"181.471485\">03:01</span>  5. (Ka) na cakkhu na cakkhudhātu? ^6-4c-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"186.318935\">03:06</span> (Kha) na dhātū na sotadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"189.117142\">03:09</span> (Ka) na cakkhu na cakkhudhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"196.503771\">03:16</span> (Kha) na dhātū na ghānadhātu?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"200.856149\">03:20</span> (Ka) na cakkhu na cakkhudhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"205.95983\">03:25</span> (Kha) na dhātū na dhammadhātu?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"212.790942\">03:32</span>  (Ka) na dhammo na dhammadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"216.33811\">03:36</span> (Kha) na dhātū na cakkhudhātu?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"219.704029\">03:39</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhammadhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"226.607594\">03:46</span> (Kha) na dhātū na manoviññāṇadhātu? (Cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Suddhadhātuvāro ^6-4d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"248.408083\">04:08</span>  6. (Ka) cakkhu dhātu? ^6-4d-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"251.692495\">04:11</span> (Kha) dhātū cakkhu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"253.336269\">04:13</span> (Ka) sotaṃ dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"258.879968\">04:18</span> (Kha) dhātū sotaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"260.687511\">04:20</span> Ghānaṃ dhātu?…Pe… jivhā dhātu?… Kāyo dhātu?… Rūpaṃ dhātu?… Saddo dhātu?… Gandho dhātu?… Raso dhātu?… Phoṭṭhabbo dhātu?…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"281.511115\">04:41</span> (Ka) cakkhuviññāṇaṃ dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"286.116106\">04:46</span> (Kha) dhātū cakkhuviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"289.398296\">04:49</span> (Ka) sotaviññāṇaṃ dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"295.055136\">04:55</span> (Kha) dhātū sotaviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"298.211377\">04:58</span> … Ghānaviññāṇaṃ?…Pe… jivhāviññāṇaṃ?… Kāyaviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"308.369984\">05:08</span> (Ka) mano dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"313.542196\">05:13</span> (Kha) dhātū mano?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"315.70991\">05:15</span> (Ka) manoviññāṇaṃ dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"321.872244\">05:21</span> (Kha) dhātū manoviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"324.850811\">05:24</span> (Ka) dhammo dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"330.262866\">05:30</span> (Kha) dhātū dhammo?</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"335.105168\">05:35</span> 7. (Ka) na cakkhu na dhātu? ^6-4d-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"340.787797\">05:40</span> (Kha) na dhātū na cakkhu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"343.736314\">05:43</span> (Ka) na sotaṃ na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"349.298243\">05:49</span> (Kha) na dhātū na sotaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"352.582157\">05:52</span> … Na ghānaṃ?… Na jivhā?… Na kāyo?… Na rūpaṃ? … Na saddo?… Na gandho?… Na raso?… Na phoṭṭhabbo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"371.636129\">06:11</span> (Ka) na cakkhuviññāṇaṃ na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"377.146553\">06:17</span> (Kha) na dhātū na cakkhuviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"381.236406\">06:21</span> … Na sotaviññāṇaṃ?…Pe… na ghānaviññāṇaṃ?… Na jivhāviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"392.464082\">06:32</span> (Ka) na kāyaviññāṇaṃ na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"399.698171\">06:39</span> (Kha) na dhātū na kāyaviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"403.540313\">06:43</span> (Ka) na mano na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"409.110167\">06:49</span> (Kha) na dhātū na mano?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"412.417974\">06:52</span> (Ka) na manoviññāṇaṃ na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"418.467845\">06:58</span> (Kha) na dhātū na manoviññāṇaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"422.061355\">07:02</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"428.457158\">07:08</span> (Kha) na dhātū na dhammo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"436.527645\">07:16</span> #### 4. Suddhadhātumūlacakkavāro ^6-4e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"442.196144\">07:22</span> 8. (Ka) cakkhu dhātu? ^6-4e-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"443.946173\">07:23</span> (Kha) dhātū sotaṃ?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"445.965798\">07:25</span> (Ka) cakkhu dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"447.389331\">07:27</span> (Kha) dhātū dhammo?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"449.472561\">07:29</span> (Ka) dhammo dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"451.397008\">07:31</span> (Kha) dhātū cakkhu?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"452.865384\">07:32</span> (Ka) dhammo dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"454.933408\">07:34</span> (Kha) dhātū manoviññāṇaṃ? (Cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"467.870465\">07:47</span> 9. (Ka) na cakkhu na dhātu? ^6-4e-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"472.503114\">07:52</span> (Kha) na dhātū na sotaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"475.347113\">07:55</span> (Ka) na cakkhu na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"481.290475\">08:01</span> (Kha) na dhātū na ghānaṃ?…Pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"484.708536\">08:04</span> (Ka) na cakkhu na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"489.784206\">08:09</span> (Kha) na dhātū na dhammo?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"492.858215\">08:12</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"498.894856\">08:18</span> (Kha) na dhātū na cakkhu?…Pe…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"502.264565\">08:22</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhātu?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"507.856485\">08:27</span> (Kha) na dhātū na manoviññāṇaṃ? (Cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>  <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"536.279569\">08:56</span> Paṇṇattiuddesavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) niddeso</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Padasodhanavāro ^6-4f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"544.28685\">09:04</span> 10. (Ka) cakkhu cakkhudhātūti? ^6-4f-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"550.492077\">09:10</span> Dibbacakkhu paññācakkhu cakkhu, na cakkhudhātu. Cakkhudhātu cakkhu ceva cakkhudhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"560.273037\">09:20</span> (Kha) cakkhudhātu cakkhūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"566.683867\">09:26</span> (Ka) sotaṃ sotadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"570.982722\">09:30</span> Dibbasotaṃ taṇhāsotaṃ sotaṃ, na sotadhātu. Sotadhātu sotañceva sotadhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"580.950053\">09:40</span> (Kha) sotadhātu sotanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"585.382546\">09:45</span> (Ka) ghānaṃ ghānadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"592.426605\">09:52</span> (Kha) ghānadhātu ghānanti? Āmantā. (Jivhāpi ghānadhātusadisā).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"605.196798\">10:05</span> (Ka) kāyo kāyadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"610.179852\">10:10</span> Kāyadhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso kāyo [avaseso kāyo kāyo (syā.)], na kāyadhātu. Kāyadhātu kāyo ceva kāyadhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"620.485755\">10:20</span> (Kha) kāyadhātu kāyoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"624.893154\">10:24</span> (Ka) rūpaṃ rūpadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"631.531651\">10:31</span> Rūpadhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ rūpaṃ, na rūpadhātu. Rūpadhātu rūpañceva rūpadhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"641.608772\">10:41</span> (Kha) rūpadhātu rūpanti? Āmantā. (Saddo ghānasadiso).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"654.359235\">10:54</span>  (Ka) gandho gandhadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"658.424989\">10:58</span> Sīlagandho samādhigandho paññāgandho gandho, na gandhadhātu. Gandhadhātu gandho ceva gandhadhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"669.520428\">11:09</span> (Kha) gandhadhātu gandhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"674.079002\">11:14</span> (Ka) raso rasadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"680.100989\">11:20</span> Attharaso dhammaraso vimuttiraso raso, na rasadhātu. Rasadhātu raso ceva rasadhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"689.710228\">11:29</span> (Kha) rasadhātu rasoti? Āmantā. (Phoṭṭhabbo ghānasadiso).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"701.10928\">11:41</span> (Ka) cakkhuviññāṇaṃ cakkhuviññāṇadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"709.929702\">11:49</span> (Kha) cakkhuviññāṇadhātu cakkhuviññāṇanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"716.12429\">11:56</span> Sotaviññāṇaṃ…pe… ghānaviññāṇaṃ… jivhāviññāṇaṃ… kāyaviññāṇaṃ….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"725.183846\">12:05</span> (Ka) mano manodhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"730.504546\">12:10</span> Manodhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso mano, na manodhātu. Manodhātu mano ceva manodhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"740.686798\">12:20</span> (Kha) manodhātu manoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"745.133924\">12:25</span> (Ka) manoviññāṇaṃ manoviññāṇadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"754.074513\">12:34</span> (Kha) manoviññāṇadhātu manoviññāṇanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"759.538816\">12:39</span> (Ka) dhammo dhammadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"765.978116\">12:45</span> Dhammadhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso dhammo, na dhammadhātu. Dhammadhātu dhammo ceva dhammadhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"777.264712\">12:57</span> (Kha) dhammadhātu dhammoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"783.963963\">13:03</span> 11. (Ka) na cakkhu na cakkhudhātūti? Āmantā. ^6-4f-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"791.798449\">13:11</span> (Kha) na cakkhudhātu na cakkhūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"794.824142\">13:14</span> Dibbacakkhu paññācakkhu na cakkhudhātu, cakkhu. Cakkhuñca cakkhudhātuñca ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na ceva cakkhu na ca cakkhudhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"808.350624\">13:28</span> (Ka) na sotaṃ na sotadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"816.560521\">13:36</span> (Kha) na sotadhātu na sotanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"820.265816\">13:40</span> Dibbasotaṃ taṇhāsotaṃ na sotadhātu, sotaṃ. Sotañca sotadhātuñca ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na ceva sotaṃ na ca sotadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"834.587289\">13:54</span> (Ka) na ghānaṃ na ghānadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"842.840062\">14:02</span> (Kha) na ghānadhātu na ghānanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"847.814239\">14:07</span> Na jivhā… (saṃkhittaṃ [yaṃ saṃkhittaṃ (syā.)], ubhato āmantā).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"858.836222\">14:18</span> (Ka) na kāyo na kāyadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"866.342658\">14:26</span> (Kha) na kāyadhātu na kāyoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"869.585845\">14:29</span> Kāyadhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso na kāyadhātu, kāyo. Kāyañca kāyadhātuñca ṭhapetvā avaseso [avaseso kāyo (syā.)] na ceva kāyo na ca kāyadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"885.439267\">14:45</span> (Ka) na rūpaṃ na rūpadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"892.970016\">14:52</span> (Kha) na rūpadhātu na rūpanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"896.527017\">14:56</span> Rūpadhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na rūpadhātu, rūpaṃ. Rūpañca rūpadhātuñca ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na ceva rūpaṃ na ca rūpadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"913.901911\">15:13</span> Na saddo…pe… na gandho na gandhadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"921.25961\">15:21</span> Na gandhadhātu na gandhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"924.472972\">15:24</span> Sīlagandho samādhigandho paññāgandho na gandhadhātu, gandho. Gandhañca gandhadhātuñca ṭhapetvā avaseso na ceva gandho na ca gandhadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"940.575673\">15:40</span> (Ka) na raso na rasadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"948.402045\">15:48</span> (Kha) na rasadhātu na rasoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"951.130611\">15:51</span> Attharaso dhammaraso vimuttiraso na rasadhātu, raso. Rasañca rasadhātuñca ṭhapetvā avaseso na ceva raso na ca rasadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"964.523719\">16:04</span> Na phoṭṭhabbo…pe… na cakkhuviññāṇaṃ na cakkhuviññāṇadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"977.121614\">16:17</span> Na cakkhuviññāṇadhātu na cakkhuviññāṇanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"983.994534\">16:23</span> Na sotaviññāṇaṃ…pe… na ghānaviññāṇaṃ… na jivhāviññāṇaṃ… na kāyaviññāṇaṃ….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"993.533259\">16:33</span> (Ka) na mano na manodhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1002.464739\">16:42</span> (Kha) na manodhātu na manoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1005.323117\">16:45</span> Manodhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso na manodhātu, mano. Manañca manodhātuñca ṭhapetvā avaseso na ceva mano na ca manodhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1020.215918\">17:00</span> (Ka) na manoviññāṇaṃ na manoviññāṇadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1030.257379\">17:10</span> (Kha) na manoviññāṇadhātu na manoviññāṇanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1036.737614\">17:16</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhammadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1045.531495\">17:25</span> (Kha) na dhammadhātu na dhammoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1048.833262\">17:28</span> Dhammadhātuṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso na dhammadhātu, dhammo. Dhammañca dhammadhātuñca ṭhapetvā avaseso na ceva dhammo na ca dhammadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1067.051551\">17:47</span> #### 2. Padasodhanamūlacakkavāro ^6-4g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1073.917116\">17:53</span> 12. (Ka) cakkhu cakkhudhātūti? ^6-4g-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1078.406582\">17:58</span> Dibbacakkhu paññācakkhu cakkhu, na cakkhudhātu. Cakkhudhātu cakkhu ceva cakkhudhātu ca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1088.361472\">18:08</span> (Kha) dhātū sotadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1090.67819\">18:10</span> Sotadhātu dhātu ceva sotadhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū [avasesā dhātū dhātū (syā.)] na sotadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1099.706416\">18:19</span> (Ka) cakkhu cakkhudhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1105.291313\">18:25</span> Dibbacakkhu paññācakkhu cakkhu, na cakkhudhātu. Cakkhudhātu cakkhu ceva cakkhudhātu ca. Dhātū ghānadhātu…pe… dhātū dhammadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1119.759079\">18:39</span> Dhammadhātu dhātu ceva dhammadhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na dhammadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1133.589639\">18:53</span> (Yathā āyatanayamake paṇṇatti evaṃ dhātuyamakepi paṇṇatti. Cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1144.819662\">19:04</span> 13. (Ka) na cakkhu na cakkhudhātūti? Āmantā. ^6-4g-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1151.295764\">19:11</span> (Kha) na dhātū na sotadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1156.145796\">19:16</span> Na cakkhu na cakkhudhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1164.271621\">19:24</span> Na dhātū na ghānadhātu…pe… na dhātū na dhammadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1178.868497\">19:38</span>  (Cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ, sabbe āmantā ubhatopi sesepi).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1185.209153\">19:45</span> #### 3. Suddhadhātuvāro ^6-4h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1194.859463\">19:54</span> 14. (Ka) cakkhu dhātūti? Āmantā. ^6-4h-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1199.728068\">19:59</span> (Kha) dhātū cakkhudhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1202.190415\">20:02</span> Cakkhudhātu dhātu ceva cakkhudhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na cakkhudhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1211.8741\">20:11</span> Sotaṃ dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1218.582833\">20:18</span> Ghānaṃ…pe… jivhā… kāyo… rūpaṃ… saddo… gandho… raso… phoṭṭhabbo….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1230.910374\">20:30</span> (Ka) cakkhuviññāṇaṃ dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1238.372458\">20:38</span> (Kha) dhātū cakkhuviññāṇadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1241.750711\">20:41</span> Cakkhuviññāṇadhātu dhātu ceva cakkhuviññāṇadhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na cakkhuviññāṇadhātu. Sotaviññāṇaṃ…pe… ghānaviññāṇaṃ… jivhāviññāṇaṃ… kāyaviññāṇaṃ….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1261.395549\">21:01</span> (Ka) mano dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1269.173085\">21:09</span> (Kha) dhātū manodhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1271.480883\">21:11</span> Manodhātu dhātu ceva manodhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na manodhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1280.603177\">21:20</span> (Ka) manoviññāṇaṃ dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1288.403755\">21:28</span> (Kha) dhātū manoviññāṇadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1292.076562\">21:32</span> Manoviññāṇadhātu dhātu ceva manoviññāṇadhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na manoviññāṇadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1303.437429\">21:43</span> (Ka) dhammo dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1311.169898\">21:51</span> (Kha) dhātū dhammadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1314.311704\">21:54</span> Dhammadhātu dhātu ceva dhammadhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na dhammadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1325.304046\">22:05</span> 15. (Ka) na cakkhu na dhātūti? ^6-4h-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1330.998313\">22:10</span> Cakkhuṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā dhātū na cakkhu, dhātu. Cakkhuñca dhātuñca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva cakkhu na ca dhātū.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1343.443726\">22:23</span> (Kha) na dhātū na cakkhūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1347.655547\">22:27</span> Na sotaṃ na dhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1354.556764\">22:34</span> Sotaṃ ṭhapetvā…pe… ghānaṃ ṭhapetvā…pe… jivha ṭhapetvā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1361.481659\">22:41</span> (Ka) na kāyo na dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1369.554244\">22:49</span> (Kha) na dhātū na kāyadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1375.141467\">22:55</span> Na rūpaṃ na dhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1381.745036\">23:01</span> Rūpaṃ ṭhapetvā…pe… saddaṃ… gandhaṃ… rasaṃ… phoṭṭhabbaṃ… cakkhuviññāṇaṃ…pe… manoviññāṇaṃ ṭhapetvā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1396.029618\">23:16</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1404.353064\">23:24</span> (Kha) na dhātū na dhammadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1412.46781\">23:32</span>  #### 4. Suddhadhātumūlacakkavāro ^6-4i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1418.501065\">23:38</span> 16. (Ka) cakkhu dhātūti? Āmantā. ^6-4i-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1425.105307\">23:45</span> (Kha) dhātū sotadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1428.006342\">23:48</span> Sotadhātu dhātu ceva sotadhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na sotadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1441.097384\">24:01</span> Cakkhu dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1444.897339\">24:04</span> Dhātū ghānadhātu…pe… dhātū dhammadhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1449.819021\">24:09</span> Dhammadhātu dhātu ceva dhammadhātu ca. Avasesā dhātū na dhammadhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1461.828565\">24:21</span> (Cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1468.379444\">24:28</span> 17. (Ka) na cakkhu na dhātūti? ^6-4i-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1474.125133\">24:34</span> Cakkhuṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā dhātū na cakkhudhātu. Cakkhuñca dhātuñca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva cakkhu na ca dhātu.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1486.227045\">24:46</span> (Kha) na dhātū na sotadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1491.430849\">24:51</span> Na cakkhu na dhātūti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1497.858506\">24:57</span> Cakkhuṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā dhātū na cakkhu, dhātu. Cakkhu ca dhātuñca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva cakkhu na ca dhātu. Na dhātū na ghānadhātu…pe… na dhātū na dhammadhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1518.634259\">25:18</span> (Ka) na dhammo na dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1526.739748\">25:26</span> (Kha) na dhātū na cakkhudhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1531.781112\">25:31</span> Na dhammo na dhātūti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1540.24496\">25:40</span> Na dhātū na sotadhātu…pe… na dhātū na manoviññāṇadhātūti? Āmantā. <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1554.560882\">25:54</span> (Cakkaṃ bandhitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1559.24094\">25:59</span> (Yathā āyatanayamakassa paṇṇatti evaṃ dhātuyamakassa paṇṇatti vitthāretabbā)</p><p><br /></p><p>  Paṇṇattiniddesavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p> #### 2. Pavattivāro 1. uppādavāro ^6-4j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (1) Paccuppannavāro ^6-4k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1595.866048\">26:35</span> 18. (Ka) yassa cakkhudhātu uppajjati tassa sotadhātu uppajjatīti? ^6-4k-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1604.828942\">26:44</span> Sacakkhukānaṃ asotakānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ cakkhudhātu uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ sotadhātu uppajjati. Sacakkhukānaṃ sasotakānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ cakkhudhātu ca uppajjati sotadhātu ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1628.39347\">27:08</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana sotadhātu uppajjati tassa cakkhudhātu uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1635.240584\">27:15</span> Sasotakānaṃ acakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ sotadhātu uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ cakkhudhātu uppajjati. Sasotakānaṃ sacakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ sotadhātu ca uppajjati cakkhudhātu ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1658.441499\">27:38</span> (Ka) yassa cakkhudhātu uppajjati tassa ghānadhātu uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1669.164969\">27:49</span> Sacakkhukānaṃ aghānakānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ cakkhudhātu uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ ghānadhātu uppajjati. Sacakkhukānaṃ saghānakānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ cakkhudhātu ca uppajjati ghānadhātu ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1692.244499\">28:12</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana ghānadhātu uppajjati tassa cakkhudhātu uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1699.35702\">28:19</span> Saghānakānaṃ acakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ ghānadhātu uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ cakkhudhātu uppajjati. Saghānakānaṃ sacakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ ghānadhātu ca uppajjati cakkhudhātu ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1722.147303\">28:42</span>  (Ka) yassa cakkhudhātu uppajjati tassa rūpadhātu uppajjatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1734.563906\">28:54</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana rūpadhātu uppajjati tassa cakkhudhātu uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1741.471522\">29:01</span> Sarūpakānaṃ acakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ rūpadhātu uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ cakkhudhātu uppajjati. Sacakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ rūpadhātu ca uppajjati cakkhudhātu ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1764.409278\">29:24</span> (Ka) yassa cakkhudhātu uppajjati tassa manoviññāṇadhātu uppajjatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1776.08098\">29:36</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana manoviññāṇadhātu uppajjati tassa cakkhudhātu uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1783.848958\">29:43</span> Sacittakānaṃ acakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ manoviññāṇadhātu uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ cakkhudhātu uppajjati. Sacakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ manoviññāṇadhātu ca uppajjati cakkhudhātu ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1808.286232\">30:08</span> (Ka) yassa cakkhudhātu uppajjati tassa dhammadhātu uppajjatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1820.252456\">30:20</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana dhammadhātu uppajjati tassa cakkhudhātu uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1838.10859\">30:38</span> Acakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ dhammadhātu uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ cakkhudhātu uppajjati. Sacakkhukānaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ dhammadhātu ca uppajjati cakkhudhātu ca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1850.475722\">30:50</span> (Yathā āyatanayamakaṃ vibhattaṃ evaṃ dhātuyamakampi vibhajitabbaṃ, sadisaṃ kātabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1877.542462\">31:17</span> #### 3. Pariññāvāro ^6-4l-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1883.50818\">31:23</span> 19. Yo cakkhudhātuṃ parijānāti so sotadhātuṃ parijānātīti? Āmantā.…Pe… (dhātuyamakaṃ paripuṇṇaṃ peyyālena). ^6-4l-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1916.266046\">31:56</span> Dhātuyamakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa</p><p><br /></p>","media-time":1928.821}